CREATE TABLE "Invoice" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"customerId" TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES "Customer"("id"),"contractId" TEXT REFERENCES "Contract"("id"),"number" TEXT UNIQUE,"status" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'DRAFT' CHECK ("status" IN ('DRAFT','ISSUED','VOID')),"currency" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'CAD',"dueDate" TEXT NOT NULL,"subtotalCents" INTEGER NOT NULL CHECK ("subtotalCents">=0),"taxCents" INTEGER NOT NULL CHECK ("taxCents">=0),"totalCents" INTEGER NOT NULL CHECK ("totalCents">=0),"version" INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 1,"idempotencyKey" TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE,"payloadHash" TEXT NOT NULL,"issuedAt" TIMESTAMP(3),"voidReason" TEXT,"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
CREATE TABLE "InvoiceItem" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"invoiceId" TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES "Invoice"("id"),"position" INTEGER NOT NULL,"description" TEXT NOT NULL,"quantity" INTEGER NOT NULL CHECK ("quantity">0),"unitPriceCents" INTEGER NOT NULL CHECK ("unitPriceCents">=0),"taxRateBps" INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0 CHECK ("taxRateBps" BETWEEN 0 AND 10000),"subtotalCents" INTEGER NOT NULL,"taxCents" INTEGER NOT NULL,UNIQUE("invoiceId","position"));
CREATE TABLE "Payment" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"invoiceId" TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES "Invoice"("id"),"amountCents" INTEGER NOT NULL CHECK ("amountCents">0),"method" TEXT NOT NULL,"reference" TEXT,"note" TEXT,"idempotencyKey" TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE,"payloadHash" TEXT NOT NULL,"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
CREATE TABLE "PaymentReversal" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"paymentId" TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE REFERENCES "Payment"("id"),"reason" TEXT NOT NULL,"actorId" TEXT NOT NULL,"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
CREATE TABLE "InvoiceCounter" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"value" INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0);
